      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "We're not bound by physical laws in VR, so I don't see a strict need for this - lack of interdependence allows for new photographic opportunities, great!\nOne could add an option to simulate this interdependence you describe for people who want to translate their real-life photography experience though.",
