      "value": "@{5f2fef67654cd449145490e4|full_name}: As a photographer for over a decade, you nailed it. I hope this is altered. It leads to confusion for pro and amateur photographers, it detracts from real world learning (skills/knowledge gained in VR can be transferred to a real DSLR) and ends up seeming kinda unprofessional to those who are pro/amateur photogs since it doesn't behave as expected.",
